  (text "12.6 V input, centre-positive, 2 A: mains PSU, MPPT solar or crank converter."
    (at 20.32 166.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "16f8cb47-1c6b-5d9a-819e-145305eb2455"))
  (text "UPS direct connections + PCH cables"
    (at 20.32 134.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "03e92052-3f1a-4168-934d-b123b27f94ae"))
  (text "C1 charge: source -> supplied DC5521 lead -> UPS; CHG_12V6_IN + GND; no charge current passes through the PCH"
    (at 20.32 138.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "9aa20ec9-3a26-4885-b0f4-84f9f9d68ba3"))
  (text "C2 switch: supplied red/black self-lock button -> UPS switch port; SW_1 + SW_2; no PCH connection"
    (at 20.32 142.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "79acc7a5-3ba9-4d06-ae91-c4ef9721212a"))
  (text "C3 header: PCH J5 -> UPS 2x4; UPS_5V + GND only; the UPS I2C and 3V3 pins stay open"
    (at 20.32 146.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "752a3b39-b164-41aa-8fc4-653a2d5cb417"))
  (text "C4 12.6 V: UPS XH2.54 -> PCH J7; UPS_12V6 + GND"
    (at 20.32 150.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "2f71ec05-6562-4420-9cff-6866b4ff52d2"))
  (text "The supplied self-lock button plugs directly into the UPS switch input; there is no switch LED or PCH switch path."
    (at 20.32 172.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "75607315-e804-533b-b665-2c43db92601f"))
  (text "No fuse on the PCH; the Module 3S protects the pack. The PCH carries no charge current."
    (at 20.32 178.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "19192ffe-0232-5fba-b564-a2d3e26db6fe"))
  (text "UPS_5V reaches the Pi through the supplied USB-C cable; it is the only supply."
    (at 20.32 184.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "4ac0a306-058b-5928-98cb-1f690c4882b7"))
  (text "J3 is the supplied red/black UPS button; connect only to the UPS switch port."
    (at 20.32 190.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "6a8ab1fa-a774-51ad-acd0-07058887537b"))
  (text "J16 is the PCH: UPS_5V, GND and UPS_12V6 only. The J8 12.6 V aux is unused."
